# Trust, Legal & User Consent (MVP)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-trust-consent-flow.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-trust-consent-flow.md)

## Goal

Trust without friction. Legal visible and accessible — never a blocker before care value.

Feel: *"We respect your information."*  
Never: *"Complete legal steps before we help you."*

## Public

Footer always: Privacy Policy · Terms of Service · Contact · Help  
Pages: `/privacy` · `/terms` · `/contact` · `/support` (`/help` alias) · `/about`  
Home `/welcome`: Research Preview + Free Early Access (not forever) + short FAQ (`HOME_FAQ_IDS`) below hero — not a separate legal wall.  
Help `/support`: full FAQ. `/capabilities`: honest works-well / still-improving.

Support: `davidsolenos@gmail.com`

## Early access / signup

Required checkboxes with clickable links to Terms + Privacy.  
Submit disabled until both checked. No force-read wall.

## Product entry

One-time Research Preview ack for new entrants (`ResearchPreviewAckGate`). Returning users skip. Early Access badge in header.

## In product

Menu → About: Help · Privacy · Terms · About · Contact — never interrupt capture.  
Quiet upload privacy notice · post-response understanding feedback · emergency boundary (not alarm).

## Never

Hide legal only in fine print · turn SolenOS into a legal website · hard-block Begin with a document wall · claim “free forever”
